- Did not rebuild the ELF (B6/B2/SECRET rebuild in the same turn covers the compiler)
- Did not re-run the full typestate smoke in this audit file
- Did not edit `chs_rt_fs.c`, `std/os/*`, or AGY `ooda/pm/`

